Prasasti Mantyasih

Prasasti Mantyasih ana loro, Mantyasih I lan II. Loro-lorone tinulis ing lempeng &lt;a href="tembaga"&gt;tembaga&lt;/a&gt;.Prasasti tinulis ing jaman &lt;a href="Watukura%20Dyah%20Balitung"&gt;Watukura Dyah Balitung&lt;/a&gt;, nalika angka taun ngancik 907 M.
Kanggone wong &lt;a href="Magelang"&gt;Magelang&lt;/a&gt;, mligi &lt;a href="d%C3%A9sa"&gt;désa&lt;/a&gt; Meteseh, prasasti iki dianggep wigati. Seka Prasasti Mantyasih I, &lt;a href="Prasasti%20Gilikan"&gt;Prasasti Gilikan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Prasasti%20Poh"&gt;Prasasti Poh&lt;/a&gt;, pamaréntah ngukuhaké dina ulang taune kutha Magelang.
Ing tulisané, sinebut yèn Désa Mantyasih didadeake &lt;a href="sima"&gt;sima&lt;/a&gt;. Déné raja-raja &lt;a href="karajan%20Mataram%20Kuna"&gt;karajan Mataram Kuna&lt;/a&gt; uga dijlentrehke akèh ing kéné, ya iku &lt;a href="Sanjaya"&gt;Sanjaya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rakai%20Panangkaran"&gt;Rakai Panangkaran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rakai%20Panunggalan"&gt;Rakai Panunggalan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rakai%20Warak"&gt;Rakai Warak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rakai%20Garung"&gt;Rakai Garung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rakai%20Pikatan"&gt;Rakai Pikatan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rakai%20Kayuwangi"&gt;Rakai Kayuwangi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Rakai%20Watuhumalang"&gt;Rakai Watuhumalang&lt;/a&gt;.
