<doc id="4596" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4596" title="Dhondhong">
Dhondhong

Dhondhong yaiku tetuwuhan woh kang kagolong ing kulawarga &lt;a href="familia"&gt;suku&lt;/a&gt; pelem-peleman (&lt;a href="Anacardiaceae"&gt;Anacardiaceae&lt;/a&gt;). Tetuwuhan iki misuwur karan jeneng ambarella, hog plum, hevi (&lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;), mokah (&lt;a href="Kamboja"&gt;Kamboja&lt;/a&gt;), gway (&lt;a href="Myanmar"&gt;Myanmar&lt;/a&gt;), makak farang (&lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;).
&lt;a href="Woh"&gt;Woh&lt;/a&gt; dhondhong bisa dipangan langsung saka &lt;a href="wit"&gt;wit&lt;/a&gt; utawa asring uga diolah/ di&lt;a href="rujak"&gt;rujak&lt;/a&gt;, asinan, acar, utawa didadèkaké selé. Woh dhondhong duwé wiiji tunggal kang wujudé serabut. Ing tlatah &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; wiji dhondhong jenengngé &lt;a href="pelok"&gt;pelok&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="godhong"&gt;godhong&lt;/a&gt; dhondhong didadèkaké mumbu kanggo nyangan/nyayur &lt;a href="brengkes"&gt;brengkes iwak&lt;/a&gt;.
